{"id":"3f09cae20e23b713","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain.md","title":"有限前驱链与局部闭包","display":"lem-tree-predecessor-chain — 有限前驱链与局部闭包","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain","aliases":["72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain"],"display":"lem-tree-predecessor-chain — 有限前驱链与局部闭包","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Def.2.6; proof of Thm.2.8; print154–155; PDF166–167","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-tree-predecessor-chain — 有限前驱链与局部闭包"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b42c29cdcade905\" href=\"?note=1b42c29cdcade905\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor\">72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Def.2.6; proof of Thm.2.8; print154–155; PDF166–167"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec,\\alpha[n],P_n(\\alpha)\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec,\\alpha[n],P_n(\\alpha)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b42c29cdcade905\" href=\"?note=1b42c29cdcade905\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor\">72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\\subseteq\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\},\\qquad |\\alpha[n]|\\in\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha[n]\\subseteq\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\},\\qquad |\\alpha[n]|\\in\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta=\\gamma\\lor\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta=\\gamma\\lor\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta[n]\\subsetneq\\alpha[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta[n]\\subsetneq\\alpha[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\left(P_n(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha[n]\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta=P_n(\\alpha)\\lor\\beta\\prec P_n(\\alpha))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha[n]\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\left(P_n(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha[n]\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta=P_n(\\alpha)\\lor\\beta\\prec P_n(\\alpha))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是把原书 Definition 2.6 与 Theorem 2.8 证明中使用的有限链事实单独列出；印刷 pp.154–155 / PDF pp.166–167。它适用于所有树序数，不要求结构化。</p>\n<p>证明：同时按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的树秩归纳。零情形为空。后继情形把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 加在旧链 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 上方，因为旧链元素都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的严格子树；有限性、线性和严格子树包含均保持。对旧元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>，归纳假设给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[n]\\subseteq\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\beta[n]\\subseteq\\alpha[n]\\)</span>，且新加的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[n]\">\\(\\beta[n]\\)</span>；对新元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=\\alpha\">\\(\\beta=\\alpha\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 严格包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}\\)</span>。极限情形直接继承第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个子树的有限链及闭包事实，再用子树关系的传递性。非空有限线性链有唯一最大元；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\">\\(P_n\\)</span> 的定义正取该元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor","status":"resolved","id":"1b42c29cdcade905","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor","status":"resolved","id":"1b42c29cdcade905","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec,\\alpha[n],P_n(\\alpha)$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec,\\alpha[n],P_n(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]\\subseteq\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\},\\qquad |\\alpha[n]|\\in\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta=\\gamma\\lor\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta[n]\\subsetneq\\alpha[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\left(P_n(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha[n]\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\beta=P_n(\\alpha)\\lor\\beta\\prec P_n(\\alpha))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta[n]\\subseteq\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta=\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"P_n","display":false}],"bytes":2098,"backlinks":[{"id":"47e3f5d82f726210","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\prec,\\preccurlyeq,\\alpha[n]$ 及前驱穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain|lem-tree-predecessor-chain — 有限前驱链与局部闭包]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[lem-tree-predecessor-chain — 有限前驱链与局部闭包](72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain|lem-tree-predecessor-chain — 有限前驱链与局部闭包]]"},{"id":"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G$ 见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]；$\\alpha[n]$ 及有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。"},{"id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 见 [[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]；有限前驱链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。$\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s$，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-414","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]"}],"outgoing":["1b42c29cdcade905"]}